            </note>
            <note corresp="#d133-f2" n="2" xml:id="d133-f2-content">
                <p>The January 1966 proposal has not been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d133-f3" n="3" xml:id="d133-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to a June 6 letter from Vance and Seaborg to the President. A copy
